5ko0|v|To deal in a market; to buy or sell; to make bargains for provisions or goods. ; To expose for sale in a market; to traffic in; to sell in a market, and in an extended sense, to sell in any manner; as, most of the farmes have marketed their crops.	o:77yk,24,2;2l79,2,1;19mz,2,2~77yk,24,2;19mz,2,2;2l79,2,1	s:1p4d,25,3;2ysn,25,2;80te,25,2;3e6o,4,4;9pi6,1,1~3e6o,4,4;1p4d,25,3;80te,25,2;2ysn,25,2;9pi6,1,1
